    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτροφ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of food</i> or
				<i>nourishment,</i> of trees, <i><span class="en">
