				<u>CP</u>
				5.9.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθινούσης ἀ. φλογός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.949a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>atrophy,</i>
