			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.21.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>starvation-diet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καύσεις καὶ τομαὶ καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>in Top.</u>
					202.17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
